msgid ""
"It's like I've been dreaming and finally woken up. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Heh. A lot of things woke up today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"The time we just shared... was special. I'll never forget it for the rest "
"of my life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Neither will I."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san... I'm just gonna come out and say it. I love you... "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default> And I want you to know I'm all "
"yours. "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255"
">⑮<Color:Default><Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"I'll be waiting for you back at the club, okay? "
"<Color:255,200,200,255>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Bye-bye now. ♪"
msgstr ""

